Description: No scripts or CMake files that no package ships
 .
 CA.pl, tsget, c_rehash, shlib_wrap.sh, the CMake config files and the
 CA.pl, tsget and openssl-engine pages are not built, so their sources can
 leave the source package.
Author: The Blueberry Pie OS Authors
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-05
